@nikhilx22 Thanks Nikhil.

Keen. One thing before I commit: the free tier lists the LaunchAF badge as required. Where does it need to sit, our own site or the Shopify listing?

That decides which tier we can take.

@notesbylouis Thanks, this is useful.

Of the 170 stores whose offer was shown at least 100 times, 52 earned nothing. The funnel runs and still returns zero.

So the gap is not setup, it is the offer itself. Which is exactly your argument for building the first one with them.

@jrbrugh77 15 of your 28 designs have a single photo, Lucy's Fine Mexican Food and Columbia High Forever included.

Are those mostly local orders, or do you ship anywhere?

Changes whether a second photo is worth the work.

@roncallihigh The eight products you published on September 8 all went up without an image.

The Nike Full Zip Track Jacket at $90 is one of them.

In the collection grid they show as an empty tile.

@MainelyGenetics 34 of your 334 listings have no photo at all, so they show as a grey square in collections.

AK47 F3 #79 and Pure Pressure 50 are two of them.

Cheapest fix in the catalogue.

@8126John The darts collection you linked has 18 of its 19 products at $0.00 with a live Add to cart.

Winmau Blade 6, the Luke Humphries set, all of them.

Someone can empty that collection for nothing.

@JUCOFFrenzy Two products are listed twice at two different prices.

Unisex Basic 100% Cotton Hoodie, $30.99 and $25.90. Acid Wash Oversize Long Sleeve, $40.93 and $31.92.

Whoever finds the cheaper one pays that.

@lijy334 16 of your 18 products have an empty description.

Median price is $95, so the product page is the only place someone decides.

One line on fabric and sizing per item.

@tmttrfilm Your store name is still My Store.

It shows at the end of every browser tab, and on every link preview when someone shares the shop.

Settings, store details, one field.

@PinkCamoSoul One product in your catalogue is at $0.00 and orderable: Handmade Turquoise Bronze Dragonfly Earrings.

Live since June 5.

Worth a price check before the Cozy Season traffic lands.

